OL,3,ASearch continues for 18 passengers
OL,4,Aafter ferry capsized in northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers are continuing their search
OL,7,Ffor 18 passengers of a ferry which
OL,8,Fcapsized off the coast of northern
OL,9,FCyprus on Sunday.
OL,11,FThe vessel, which was carrying 259
OL,12,Fpassengers and eight crew members,
OL,13,Fbegan taking on water soon after
OL,14,Fdeparting the coastal town of Kyrenia
OL,15,Fin the self-proclaimed Turkish republic
OL,16,Fon Cyprus.
OL,18,FEight people have been confirmed to
OL,19,Fhave died in the incident, while 19 are
OL,20,Fcurrently being treated at hospitals in
OL,21,Fnorthern Cyprus, local authorities say.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
