OL,3,ASearch continues for 18 passengers
OL,4,Aafter ferry capsized in northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ship's captain, seven crew members,
OL,7,Fand another man were arrested on
OL,8,FMonday, while warrants have been issued
OL,9,Ffor a further seven people.
